{"seq":2,"slug":"morsel-pipeline-parallelism","title":"Morsel 驱动并行与物化边界（pipeline breaker）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/morsel-pipeline-parallelism","wordCount":2935,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"morsel-驱动并行与物化边界-pipeline-breaker\">Morsel 驱动并行与物化边界（pipeline breaker）</h1><p>一台 64 核的机器跑一条「三万个 SKU × 四千万行跨境订单明细」的广告归因查询，只加速到 8 倍就封顶。这个形状几乎总是同一个原因：查询里存在 <strong>物化边界（pipeline breaker）</strong>，硬件在等内存或磁盘，而不是在等核。本文拆解两条相互咬合的机制：<strong>morsel 驱动并行</strong>（把一次查询切成成千上万个小任务，让调度器动态分配给工作线程）与<strong>流水线/物化边界</strong>（算子必须吃完全部输入才能吐第一个输出，它把查询切成若干个串行阶段）。理解这两点，才能解释「为什么并行度调满了还是不线性、以及哪些力气是白花的」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个词先定义清楚。</p>\n<p><strong>Morsel</strong> 是执行器「一次调度」的最小数据单元：一段连续的行区间，通常取自某个行组（row group）或某个列存分区的一部分。它的选取准则是「能驻留在 CPU 缓存里」，量级在数千行——比向量大、比分区小。DuckDB 的行组默认上限约 12 万行，扫描时再按 <code>STANDARD_VECTOR_SIZE = 2048</code> 的向量切分（DuckDB 文档 <em>Parallelism</em>，<code>https://duckdb.org/docs/stable/guides/performance/parallelism</code>）；两者是上下游关系：一个 morsel 由若干向量组成。</p>\n<p><strong>流水线（pipeline）</strong> 是一段「数据可以从下往上一直流过去、中途不落盘」的算子链：扫描 → 过滤 → 投影 → 部分聚合，下游拿到一批就能算一批。上一章已讲过它的两种驱动方向，见 <a href=\"../execution-model-evolution/push-vectorized-execution\">推送式批处理与向量化执行模型</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>物化边界（pipeline breaker）</strong> 恰好相反：某类算子必须<strong>消费完全部输入</strong>才能产出第一行。排序要等所有数据到齐才能定序；哈希连接要等 build 侧建完哈希表才能探测；去重与分组要等哈希表完整才能开始输出。Graefe 在 <em>Query Evaluation Techniques for Large Databases</em>（ACM Computing Surveys 25(2), 1993）里把它们命名为 pipeline breaker，并指出它是查询计划里最主要的停顿来源——因为它同时意味着<strong>内存临时区</strong>与<strong>阶段串行</strong>。</p>\n<p>这两者是同一张图的两个视角：morsel 决定「并行度怎么切、谁执行」，pipeline breaker 决定「切出来的任务在时间轴上如何被串行阶段分隔」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[扫描 morsel 队列&lt;br/&gt;数千行一个任务] --&gt; B[过滤 / 投影&lt;br/&gt;逐批推进 无物化]&#10;  B --&gt; C{算子类型}&#10;  C --&gt;|可流式| D[部分聚合&lt;br/&gt;本线程局部哈希表]&#10;  C --&gt;|阻塞| E[物化边界&lt;br/&gt;必须吃完全部输入]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[阶段间临时区&lt;br/&gt;分区哈希表 / 有序段&lt;br/&gt;必要时落盘]&#10;  F --&gt; G[下一阶段 morsel 队列&lt;br/&gt;重新分发给工作线程]&#10;  G --&gt; H[探测 / 归并 / 最终聚合&lt;br/&gt;结果输出]\">flowchart TD\n  A[扫描 morsel 队列&lt;br/&gt;数千行一个任务] --&gt; B[过滤 / 投影&lt;br/&gt;逐批推进 无物化]\n  B --&gt; C{算子类型}\n  C --&gt;|可流式| D[部分聚合&lt;br/&gt;本线程局部哈希表]\n  C --&gt;|阻塞| E[物化边界&lt;br/&gt;必须吃完全部输入]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[阶段间临时区&lt;br/&gt;分区哈希表 / 有序段&lt;br/&gt;必要时落盘]\n  F --&gt; G[下一阶段 morsel 队列&lt;br/&gt;重新分发给工作线程]\n  G --&gt; H[探测 / 归并 / 最终聚合&lt;br/&gt;结果输出]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>是否物化边界</th>\n<th>阻塞原因</th>\n<th>阶段间载体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Seq Scan / Filter / Project</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>无（流式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Join（build 侧）</td>\n<td><strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>需完整哈希表才能探测</td>\n<td>分区哈希表，可溢写磁盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sort / TopN（全局）</td>\n<td><strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>需全序才能输出</td>\n<td>有序段（run）+ 归并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Aggregate（全局）</td>\n<td><strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>需完整分组表</td>\n<td>哈希表，可溢写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash Aggregate（部分/本地）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>各组可分片独立</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Window（无界帧）</td>\n<td><strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>依赖全部行的分区序</td>\n<td>分区缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULL 消除 / DISTINCT</td>\n<td>常为<strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>依赖完整去重集</td>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"morsel-驱动并行-调度器-任务粒度与-numa-亲和\">Morsel 驱动并行：调度器、任务粒度与 NUMA 亲和</h2><p>2026 年主流分析引擎的并行模型，基本都收敛到 Leis、Kemper、Neumann 在 <em>Morsel-Driven Parallelism: A NUMA-Aware Query Evaluation Framework for the Many-Core Age</em>（SIGMOD 2014，DOI <code>10.1145/2588555.2610507</code>）中确立的形态。它的四条主张值得逐条对照：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，工作线程数固定，不按数据量预先分区。</strong> 引擎启动时就起与硬件线程数相当的 worker（DuckDB 里由 <code>SET threads</code> / <code>PRAGMA threads</code> 控制，默认取核数），查询执行期间不再创建线程。这与 Volcano 时代「按分区起线程」的 exchange 模型（Graefe, <em>Encapsulation of Parallelism in the Volcano Query Processing System</em>, SIGMOD 1990）正好相反：后者在计划里插入 exchange 算子，把数据静态切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 份，每份一个线程；前者把并行度从计划树上移走，交给调度器。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，任务粒度是一个 morsel，而非一个分区。</strong> 调度器维护一条待处理 morsel 队列，worker 空闲时取一个 morsel、执行整条流水线片段、丢掉它、再取下一个。由此得到<strong>弹性（elasticity）</strong>：实际并行度取决于当下有多少 worker 空闲，而非计划里写死的分区数。同一条查询在忙碌的机器上跑得慢但不会饿死别人，在空闲机器上自动吃满全部核——这是静态分区做不到的。取任务用工作窃取（work-stealing）的变体：全局原子计数器或每线程本地队列 + 窃取，成本远低于一个 morsel 的计算量。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，NUMA 亲和通过数据分区而非线程绑定实现。</strong> 每个 socket 上建一份物理本地的中间结构（哈希表分片、部分聚合表），调度时优先把「属于本 socket 的 morsel」派给本 socket 的 worker。跨 socket 访问远程内存的延迟是本地的一倍以上，而 morsel 级粒度足够细，让「就近调度」有实现的余地。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，算子内部不假设单线程。</strong> 算子的并行性由调度器提供，算子只负责写「处理一个 morsel」的逻辑——这比 exchange 模型轻量，因为不需要为每个算子实现并行的数据交换协议。</p>\n<p>morsel 大小是这套机制唯一的调参旋钮，被两个方向拉扯：太小则任务调度与原子取任务的固定开销占比过高；太大则负载不均、尾部长（一个慢 morsel 拖住整个阶段），且工作集溢出缓存。论文的经验是选「能装进缓存」的量级，工程上往往与行组大小对齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物化边界-判定-代价与串行化\">物化边界：判定、代价与串行化</h2><p>物化边界的代价可以直接写出来。设一条查询有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个流水线阶段、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个物化算子，则墙钟时间下界为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>wall</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>workers</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>task</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>spill</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{wall}} \\ge \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\max_{t \\in \\text{workers}} T_{\\text{task}}(t, i) \\;+\\; \\sum_{j=1}^{m} T_{\\text{spill}}(j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wall</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">workers</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7795em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">task</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0652em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">spill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是各阶段内所有 worker 里最慢那个（尾延迟决定阶段长度），第二项是溢写与回读的 I/O。并行度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 只能压缩第一项里「可分摊」的部分，对第二项无能为力——这就是开头 64 核只跑出 8 倍的结构性原因。若一个阶段里 30% 的活是必须串行的溢写与归并，Amdahl 上限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(p) = \\frac{1}{f + (1-f)/p}, \\quad f = 0.30 \\Rightarrow S(\\infty) \\approx 3.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 只有 5%，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 时上限也只有约 13.6 倍。所以<strong>优化物化边界比堆核更划算</strong>。</p>\n<p>代价的三个来源：<strong>空间</strong>（哈希表与有序段至少与原数据同量级）、<strong>I/O</strong>（超内存阈值后溢写磁盘，回读成为新瓶颈）、<strong>串行</strong>（阶段之间无法重叠，前一阶段全量结束、后一阶段才开始）。</p>\n<p>第三个来源存在一条常被忽略的性质：<strong>阶段之间的屏障是「全量」还是「分区局部」</strong>。全局排序的屏障是全量的——任何一个 morsel 没排完，全局就无法定序。而哈希连接若做了 radix 分区，屏障就退化为「每个分区独立」：分区 7 的 build 完成即可探测分区 7，无需等分区 8。把全局屏障拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分区局部屏障，是让并行度不被单个慢任务钉死的关键技巧——代价是分区过程中要额外物化一次。</p>\n<p>Spark 的模型是这套理论在分布式上的投影：一个 shuffle 就是一次物化边界，DAG 调度按 stage 串行推进（Spark RDD Programming Guide，<code>https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/rdd-programming-guide.html</code>）。不同之处只在「阶段间载体」从内存哈希表换成了网络与磁盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规避物化边界-部分聚合-radix-分区与谓词下推\">规避物化边界：部分聚合、radix 分区与谓词下推</h2><p>工程上真正见效的手段有三类，都指向「让数据在跨越边界前先变小或先散开」。</p>\n<p><strong>部分聚合（partial aggregation / pre-aggregation）。</strong> 在物化边界之前插一层「只在本 morsel 内分组」的聚合。四千万行订单按 <code>(country, campaign)</code> 分组，若先把每个 morsel 内部压成本地分组表，再送进全局哈希聚合，进入边界的数据量可能从四千万降到几万——这是分析引擎里收益最高的单条改写。它把 <code>Hash Aggregate（全局）</code> 这个 breaker 拆成 <code>Partial</code>（非阻塞）+ <code>Final</code>（阻塞），且部分结果的合并是结合律的树形归并，天然并行。</p>\n<p><strong>Radix 分区（radix partitioning）。</strong> 对连接键哈希取高位，把 build 侧切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个分区，每分区独立建表、独立探测。收益有三层：分区粒度成为可并行单位；每个分区的工作集变小，容易留在缓存里；分区键可用于 NUMA 本地化。代价是分区写出的那一次 I/O——但通常远小于全局屏障带来的尾部等待。</p>\n<p><strong>谓词下推到扫描层。</strong> 把过滤尽量压到扫描算子，让一个 morsel 在经过第一个 breaker 之前就已经是最小的。这与向量化的选择向量机制直接协同：过滤产出的是廉价的索引列表而非复制后的数据，见 <a href=\"../column-operators-simd/simd-selection-vector-model\">SIMD 通路与选择向量：批处理数据模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-参数-观测与陷阱\">工程落地：参数、观测与陷阱</h2><p>调优的目标不是「把并行度调到最大」，而是<strong>让并行度匹配阶段形状</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>大概率原因</th>\n<th>处置方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加速比远低于核数、CPU 曲线锯齿</td>\n<td>存在全局物化边界，阶段间屏障</td>\n<td>查计划里 <code>Hash Join</code>/<code>Sort</code> 的位置，先做部分聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单个 worker 长时间 100%、其余空闲</td>\n<td>工作不均，尾部长任务</td>\n<td>缩小 morsel 粒度；检查数据倾斜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存涨到阈值后骤降</td>\n<td>哈希表/有序段溢写磁盘</td>\n<td>提高内存上限，或先做 radix 分区降低单分区规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核数翻倍但耗时不变</td>\n<td>已到 Amdahl 上限，串行部分占主导</td>\n<td>优化边界而非加核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个最常见的陷阱。<strong>其一，误判并行度上限。</strong> 引擎报告的 <code>threads</code> 是线程池大小，不是有效并行度——有效并行度受「当前阶段的 morsel 数」与「共享资源争用」双重限制；一个只有 3 个 morsel 的阶段只能用 3 个核。<strong>其二，把溢写当成内存不足。</strong> 溢写不只是容量问题，也是调度问题：它让阶段必须等 I/O，而 I/O 的并行度与核数无关。</p>\n<p>在跨境场景里，这套分析最直接的应用是广告归因与履约报表：归因查询通常包含「点击流 join 订单」这类大表连接 + 分组，是物化边界的密集区；履约报表多为时序扫描 + 简单聚合，几乎全是可流式阶段——两者应使用不同的并行参数与内存预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>morsel</strong> 是执行器一次调度的小数据单元（量级数千行、以驻留缓存为准），比向量大、比分区小；DuckDB 以约 12 万行的行组为上限、按 2048 行的向量切分。</li>\n<li><strong>morsel 驱动并行</strong>（Leis et al., SIGMOD 2014）用固定 worker 池 + 动态任务队列换取弹性负载均衡，并用数据分区而非线程绑定实现 NUMA 亲和；它取代了 Volcano 式静态 exchange 分区。</li>\n<li><strong>pipeline breaker</strong>（Graefe, ACM CSUR 1993）是必须吃完全部输入才能产出的算子：哈希连接 build 侧、全局排序、全局聚合、DISTINCT。</li>\n<li>物化边界的代价是空间、I/O、串行三者之和；并行度只能压掉可分摊部分，Amdahl 上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(p) = 1/(f + (1-f)/p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定加核的天花板。</li>\n<li>把全局屏障拆成分区局部屏障（radix 分区）是让阶段不被单个慢任务钉死的关键；部分聚合是让数据在跨界前先变小的最高收益改写。</li>\n<li>调参应匹配阶段形状：可流式阶段吃并行度，阻塞阶段吃内存与分区策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Morsel 驱动并行与物化边界（pipeline breaker）","id":"morsel-驱动并行与物化边界-pipeline-breaker"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Morsel 驱动并行：调度器、任务粒度与 NUMA 亲和","id":"morsel-驱动并行-调度器-任务粒度与-numa-亲和"},{"level":2,"text":"物化边界：判定、代价与串行化","id":"物化边界-判定-代价与串行化"},{"level":2,"text":"规避物化边界：部分聚合、radix 分区与谓词下推","id":"规避物化边界-部分聚合-radix-分区与谓词下推"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：参数、观测与陷阱","id":"工程落地-参数-观测与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"列式内存布局、编码与空值位图：向量化执行的物理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/columnar-memory-layout-encoding"},"next":{"title":"向量缓冲区生命周期、缓存局部性与溢出处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/vector-buffer-lifetime-cache"}}